silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_02_materialization_leg_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'MaterializationLegConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the materialization arrow mapping the governed Mittens individual to its Icechunk chunk manifest ChunkManifest_Mittens at the Tartu Animal Clinic, carrying content hash sha256:7f4a...bf2c; also, the Icechunk chunk manifest record for the Tartu vet-record payload: chunk c-0x7f4a, hash sha256:7f4a...bf2c, back-pointer to src/papers/05_granite_substrate/sections/02_mittens_anchor.tex, dated 2026-05-18; also, clinical care plan record 77 generated for Mittens at the May 2026 Tartu Animal Clinic vet visit — receives a universal-mediator arrow from Mittens in G_Granite but is absent from the chunk manifest in M_Granite." .
